            "text": "Copy a feature flag from one project to other projects within the same organization. Provide the flag key, source project ID, and a list of target project IDs. Optionally copy scheduled changes with copy_schedule. Set copy_dependencies only when the user explicitly wants missing transitive flag dependencies copied too; existing active same-key dependencies in target projects are reused, disabled same-key dependencies are left untouched, and warnings explain any dependencies or schedules that could not be copied. Returns lists of successful and failed copies.",
